OL,5,G1600 The Motorway
OL,6,     FA patroller is attacked by a
OL,7,     Fdriver he's gone to help after a
OL,8,     Fcrash, and another driver's
OL,9,     Fluggage flies off the car's roof
OL,10,     Frack leaving their clothes strewn
OL,11,     Facross the carriageway.
OL,12,G1700 Motorway Cops: Catching Britain's
OL,13,G     Speeders
OL,14,     FAn urgent call leads to a
OL,15,     Fmultivehicle pursuit to rescue a
OL,16,     Fchild. PC Ian tracks down the
OL,17,     Fsuspect on the M6, but is the
OL,18,     Fdriver alone?
