OL,5,G1800 Police Interceptors
OL,6,     FPresenters Rick Edwards and Ortis
OL,7,     FDelay are out with the police
OL,8,     Finterceptors as they tackle the
OL,9,     Fdifficult night shift.
OL,10,G1900 Police Interceptors
OL,11,     FIn this special episode, the
OL,12,     Finterceptor's take on the young
OL,13,     Fand reckless who cause carnage on
OL,14,     Four roads and put themselves and
OL,15,     Fothers in danger.
OL,16,G2000 Motorway Cops: Catching Britain's
OL,17,G     Speeders
OL,18,     FOn the M53, PC Chris is following
OL,19,     Fa car that is driving at over
OL,20,     F90mph. When he pulls the driver
OL,21,     Fover, he detects a strong smell of
OL,22,     Fcannabis.
